Question1,Question2.
Create an HTML file named welcome.html, add a <script> tag, and display an alert with the message 'Welcome to your Playlist Builder!' when the page loads.
Answer : 
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
    <button id="btn" onclick="show()">Clickme</button>
   
</body>
 <script>
        let btn = document.getElementById("btn")
        btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
            alert('Welcome to your Playlist Builder!')
        })
    </script>
</html>

