Question 9:
Modify your insta-bio.html file to add a <button> labeled 'Show Greeting'. When the button is clicked, use JavaScript to show an alert that says 'Hello from JS!'.<br><br><em><strong>Hint:</strong> Use document.querySelector and addEventListener to connect the button with your JS code.</em>

Answer. :
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Insta Bio</title>
</head>
<body>
     <h2>My Insta Bio</h2>
    <button onclick="showBio()">Show Bio</button>
    <button id="greetBtn">Show Greeting</button>
</body>
<script>
   
    function showBio(){
        alert("Name: Shital Gandhi\nFavorite App: WhatsApp");
    }
    const button = document.querySelector("#greetBtn");
    button.addEventListener("click", function() {
        alert("Hello from JS!");
    });
</script>
</html>

Question 10 ,11: 
Edit your HTML file to include a <h2> tag with the text 'Top 3 Food Apps'. Use JavaScript in a <script> tag to change the color of this heading to green when the page loads.<br><br><em><strong>Hint:</strong> Use document.querySelector to select the heading and style.color to change its color.</em>

Answer :

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Top Food Apps</title>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h2 id="heading">Top 3 Food Apps</h2>

    <!-- JavaScript -->
    <script>
        // Select the heading
        const heading = document.querySelector("#heading");

        // Change color when page loads
        heading.style.color = "green";
    </script>

</body>
</html>

